# Scenario: a player's install keeps what was bought across a save, an exit and
# a relaunch -- part one (INSTALLED=<install> SCENARIO=installed_save; part two
# is installed_continue, run next on the same install).
#
# Starts from: build/checkpoints/field-area14, copied into the install's own
#   save root (<install>/data/gamedata); the game runs as a player starts it
#   (no arguments: its dotheroes.cfg, shader cache and real audio).
# Route: field14_building's way into the arrow shop (building 100), one arrow
#   bought at the counter (the HUD: wallet 0224 -> 0222, arrows 14 -> 15, the
#   quiver full), out again; then the system menu's SAVE in area 14 and
#   RESUME. The run's stop exits the game.
# Completed when: saved in area 14 (the `saved` shot); installed_continue then
#   relaunches and CONTINUEs, and its HUD shows whether the purchase was kept.
#! saves build/checkpoints/field-area14
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log PS3_VERBOSE=0
#! env WINDOW=1 VISIBLE=1 TOPMOST=1 GRAB_EVERY=2 PS3_OSD_FPS=2 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0
#! secs 400
include common.drive
include field14_route.drive

log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
call continue
state area==14,life>0 90
sleep 3
segment explore door-of-100
call door_of_100
state area==100 8
endseg
segment explore inside-100
call buy_arrow
call leave_100
state area==14 10
endseg
state area==14,life>0 10      # where the save is made
sleep 3
shot saved-here               # the HUD: wallet and arrows as saved
attempt 3 page_dialogues      # just through a door, START can go unheard
  press START                 # the system menu, on RESUME
  sleep 2
  state menu==1 4
end
press DOWN                    # SAVE
sleep 1
press CROSS                   # saves at once; the menu stays on SAVE
sleep 6
shot saved
press UP                      # RESUME
sleep 1
press CROSS
sleep 2
state life>0 5
